flowchart TD
    STATE[a piece of state] --> Q{read by many unrelated features?}
    Q -->|no, one feature| FEAT[feature state Ch 38]
    Q -->|no, one screen| UI[UI state Ch 6]
    Q -->|yes, app/session| HOLD[focused @Singleton holder + StateFlow]
    HOLD --> DUR{must survive process death?}
    DUR -->|yes| BACK[DataStore/Room Ch 4/22]
    DUR -->|no| MEM[in-memory, recompute]
